", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031360_1625427428185030_2711203823001816376_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Dbd4eVhqKNAQ7kNvwH9TUYJ&_nc_oc=AdpQE73UyLgZZxOiBZgx5bComDJhVMYCYrimpox5MLs970EMlat5KXjyaGVtE8wqajw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af42yx_uLU-bufPICUnWz825YeT7bR2-SzGRqp1Z7zaOqA&oe=6A0C66EA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Lite.png", "id": "488641690876402", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974570_488641694209735_5817461652717182570_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sJVdw6wu8rgQ7kNvwGjZT1y&_nc_oc=AdoNEycrWOivThQJtfM3RJRBUB3w-FeiDy3PX6bT0b8U0vGYQEC2ZYgI_Sa8KeKF-xQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af607AhFJ29Mih2K8zKn1KQSdvhkSXqwigIligsV-SDn8Q&oe=6A0C791E"}, "display_name": "Skillveri Aura MR Lite Welding Simulator", "keywords": ["Aura", "MR", "Lite", "Welding", "Skillveri"], "long_description": "The welding simulator trusted by industries, schools, and colleges is now yours to try ! Perform GMAW welding with Butt joint in 2G & T joint in 2F, on mild steel at 1/8 inches thickness. Progress through multiple difficulty levels and get your performance analysed with a \tdetailed scorecard. Please note that this is the Lite version of our simulator. If you want your school or organization to buy our fully loaded, feature-rich Pro version, write to us at sales@skillveri.com ", "short_description": "The welding simulator trusted by industries, schools, and colleges is now yours to try ! Perform GMAW welding with Butt joint in 2G & T joint in 2F, on mild steel at 3.2mm thickness. Progress through multiple difficulty levels and get your performance analysed with a \tdetailed scorecard. Please note that this is the Lite version of our simulator. If you want your school or organization to buy our fully loaded, feature-rich Pro version, write to us at sales@skillveri.com"}]}, "devel